  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Die Arche - Help for refugees from Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In addition to our offers for our Arche children, we are currently also committed to the refugee families from Ukraine. The images and the effects of the war, which is forcing hundreds of thousands of people to leave their homes, are of great concern to us at the Arche. Our Arche locations distribute clothing, food, water, and hot meals to the refugee families. In addition, we organize schooling and programs for refugee children and consult the arriving families on further steps.</narrative>
  </description>
